WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.800
Every morning, the road opens before us.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.600
We walk together, carried by the same hope.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
The song of the faithful rises beneath the trees.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.400
Here, memory is handed down from generation to generation.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.500
And the light passes through the leaves.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Tomorrow, we will come back.
